      "json_key": "sample_sequence_strip",
      "text": "Create an original four-panel storyboard source sheet, a precise 2 by 2 grid of equal square panels separated by narrow plain white gutters. Target2048x2048square. Image1 is the selected adult explorer canon in her olive field outfit; image2 is the selected empty railway platform environment. Preserve the same original adult woman, dark teal short asymmetric bob, one silver streak at her left temple and left-eyebrow scar, olive field jacket, dark tank top, cargo trousers, brown boots and canvas satchel. Match the clean anime/painterly style and dusk blue-violet lighting with warm canopy lamps.\nAll four panels use the SAME fixed eye-level camera, SAME stationary background geometry (canopy, columns, blank sign, platform and distant hills), SAME scale and lighting, with the explorer full body in the left foreground on the platform safely behind the edge.\nRead left-to-right then down:\nTop-left: relaxed standing, looking ahead.\nTop-right: she lightly adjusts the shoulder satchel strap with one hand.\nBottom-left: she glances toward the distant track while keeping her feet in place.\nBottom-right: she returns to a calm forward gaze, hands relaxed.\nVery restrained movement, all feet and head inside every panel, adult natural anatomy. No train, other people, words, letters, panel numbers, captions, logos, watermarks, speech bubbles, UI, arrows or decorative borders. This is an illustrative controlled storyboard, not a claim of measured temporal consistency.",
      "sha256": "79642f6ffd8fce6dbeb581b774f3b58249bb750de897b63fe0e89c9f2f5e12a4",
      "hash_scope": "Exact prompt string encoded as UTF-8, no added newline"
